            <li><strong>Security & Authentication</strong>: Kerberos tickets, OAuth2 tokens, and TLS mutual authentication across untrusted networks.</li>
            <li><strong>Persistence & State Management</strong>: Distributed caching (Redis), distributed queues (Kafka), and replicated data stores.</li>
