        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-900 font-medium">
          Connects on-prem private infrastructure to public clouds (via AWS DirectConnect / Azure ExpressRoute). Enables <strong>Cloud Bursting</strong>: running steady-state baseline workloads on-premises and bursting to public cloud during peak traffic surges.
        </p>
      </Card>

      <Card title="Community Cloud" badge="Shared Mission" glow="cyan">
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 font-bold mb-1">Shared by organizations with common compliance goals.</p>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-900 font-medium">
