        </p>
      </Card>

      <Card title="Multi-Cloud" badge="Vendor Diversification" glow="amber">
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 font-bold mb-1">Using multiple independent public cloud providers.</p>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-900 font-medium">
          Distributing workloads across AWS, GCP, and Azure simultaneously to avoid vendor lock-in, optimize regional latency, and survive catastrophic single-provider outages.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
    <SpeakerNotes>
      Explain Cloud Bursting architectures: database remains on private hardware while stateless web pods scale out on AWS.
    </SpeakerNotes>
